SYfrkT7j8ApngCKqCnCra5ulmzg6H6ttG0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEfbE8jRLbw1Cfrz2Vz55J9Hd9f5rIRoNpM9myGLbEDRQ&oe=6A75C5E4"}, {"file_name": "SampleScene_4K_17.05.2025_15-06-15.png", "id": "1733164250603383", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499361329_1733164253936716_5116391949939568888_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=P8xjTTRBWYgQ7kNvwF2IZ_9&_nc_oc=Adr2TOkXA96PZxRMV47e9keBp3Uf0-vJMfUWL-bal7ViWP2C5Eal1Tx1FNbb1mHPhfA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFhcnrY0nIaCUMvno0ve7VxIRYLyP69OKfdiBR65thUdQ&oe=6A75E69B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Untitled571_20250630144933.png", "id": "719729697423252", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820594_719729700756585_5813998063970535049_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=glT0-nFK7TIQ7kNvwGm-HsO&_nc_oc=Adpm7JzQOJvYAa4_oPzw60tBULhMozH891_23967JXvWNaX2DC2vU9JU2PNn5LMoTE4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGL5EsHoiZJE4VOV8mdXKnOkGQkACAjAe96gMk8v0Sn1A&oe=6A75F611"}, "display_name": "Bouncing Baboon", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Bouncing Baboon is a explorable game where you can bounce and swing your way through the game, there are a variety of maps you can play through, such as:\n\nForest - Jump around on trampolines or climb up trees for a ton of fun\n\nCaves - Go down the slippery slide into the echoing cave where you will be tasked with mining resources (in a future update)\n\nShop - take a break from the chaos and put on some wear for your baboon\n\nBeach - Jump from platforms sitting on the water to jumping in the water and chill with friends\n\nShore - Ride in the giant ocean in this map with the brand new boats\n\nPool - Swim with friends in this smaller map or get a tan from the upstairs portion\n\nwhether you're a parkour master or a laid-back player, Bouncing Baboon is the game for everyone", "short_